// CERT-OF-COMPLETION + TEST-CERT (v4.2.41):
//   (a) New 'completion' certificate type for non-accredited / general
//       training. Added to:
//         - cert_template::CERT_TYPES
//         - certificate_validator::AQF_TEMPLATE_REQUIREMENTS (looser rules:
//           only organisationName required; no AQF, no USI, no
//           nationally-recognised-training mark)
//         - cert_template::get_dynamic_field_catalogue (new dynamic key
//           cert.coursetitle "Course / activity name" required for completion;
//           student.fullname / cert.issuedate / cert.number / rto.name
